01:02:19.027 --> 01:02:23.031
Her daughter had a fever.

01:02:23.031 --> 01:02:25.576
Didn't stay long?

01:02:23.031 --> 01:02:25.576
I didn't check my watch.

01:02:25.576 --> 01:02:28.036
I see. Well, thanks

01:02:25.576 --> 01:02:28.036
