01:02:50.892 --> 01:02:53.521
That's what you policemen

01:02:50.892 --> 01:02:53.521
usually do, right?

01:02:53.521 --> 01:02:56.982
Must have given them all out.

01:02:53.521 --> 01:02:56.982
How'd you find me?

01:02:56.982 --> 01:03:00.027
I paid cash. No reservation.

01:02:56.982 --> 01:03:00.027
How'd you find me?

01:03:00.027 --> 01:03:02.571
Well, that's what we do,

01:03:00.027 --> 01:03:02.571
Mr. McCall.

01:03:02.571 --> 01:03:03.864
We who?

01:03:03.864 --> 01:03:06.659
We find people we need to find.

01:03:03.864 --> 01:03:06.659
We who?

01:03:06.659 --> 01:03:08.285
[♪♪♪]

