01:04:46.007 --> 01:04:50.387
Bank statements,

01:04:46.007 --> 01:04:50.387
tax returns, all jive.

01:04:50.387 --> 01:04:52.055
Looks pretty normal.

01:04:52.055 --> 01:04:55.267
All lies. Fabricated.

01:04:55.267 --> 01:04:57.269
[♪♪♪]

01:05:05.277 --> 01:05:07.237
TEDDY:

01:05:05.277 --> 01:05:07.237
<i>We need to take him cleanly.</i>

01:05:07.237 --> 01:05:08.823
Alive.

01:05:08.823 --> 01:05:11.325
A place without cameras,

01:05:08.823 --> 01:05:11.325
