01:05:11.325 --> 01:05:13.535
[♪♪♪]

01:05:21.627 --> 01:05:26.298
A man with his skills,

01:05:21.627 --> 01:05:26.298
I want to know who he really is.

01:05:26.298 --> 01:05:29.301
I want to know

01:05:26.298 --> 01:05:29.301
