01:06:41.498 --> 01:06:43.208
All right.

01:06:44.209 --> 01:06:46.587
Stand up.

01:06:58.348 --> 01:07:01.351
What the fuck is this?

01:06:58.348 --> 01:07:01.351
Masters, let's go.

01:07:01.351 --> 01:07:02.853
No witnesses.

01:07:02.853 --> 01:07:04.980
MAN:

01:07:02.853 --> 01:07:04.980
What's going on out there?

01:07:04.980 --> 01:07:08.149
[♪♪♪]

01:07:19.411 --> 01:07:21.789
What the fuck?

01:07:19.411 --> 01:07:21.789
Let's go.

01:07:21.789 --> 01:07:23.540
Shh.

01:07:23.540 --> 01:07:25.667
MASTERS:

01:07:23.540 --> 01:07:25.667
