01:07:44.102 --> 01:07:46.647
You got C. I got B.

01:07:46.647 --> 01:07:48.023
Alive.

01:07:48.023 --> 01:07:50.901
MASTERS:

01:07:48.023 --> 01:07:50.901
Yeah, yeah, alive. I'm on it.

01:07:50.901 --> 01:07:54.112
[♪♪♪]

01:08:28.563 --> 01:08:30.774
[♪♪♪]

01:08:44.830 --> 01:08:46.915
