01:08:49.751 --> 01:08:51.127
[GRUNTING]

01:09:03.515 --> 01:09:05.559
[REMAR GRUNTING]

01:09:06.935 --> 01:09:08.562
Motherfucker.

01:09:12.524 --> 01:09:14.985
Motherfucker suckered me.

01:09:24.160 --> 01:09:25.829
Goddamn it.

01:09:34.838 --> 01:09:38.050
[♪♪♪]

01:10:13.085 --> 01:10:15.378
[GROANS]

01:10:21.051 --> 01:10:22.594
[LOCK CLICKS]

01:10:22.594 --> 01:10:24.805
[♪♪♪]

01:10:57.671 --> 01:10:59.881
[♪♪♪]

01:11:15.897 --> 01:11:17.983
[♪♪♪]

01:11:29.619 --> 01:11:31.663
MASTERS:

01:11:29.619 --> 01:11:31.663
Shit.

01:11:45.010 --> 01:11:48.889
MASTERS [OVER SPEAKER]:

01:11:45.010 --> 01:11:48.889
<i>Pederson, check the closets,</i>

01:11:45.010 --> 01:11:48.889
