PEDERSON:

01:11:50.807 --> 01:11:53.101
<i>Closet's empty.</i>

01:11:55.270 --> 01:11:57.022
<i>Nothing on the back porch.</i>

01:11:57.022 --> 01:11:59.733
REMAR:

01:11:57.022 --> 01:11:59.733
<i>Fucking guy.</i>

01:11:57.022 --> 01:11:59.733
<i>Lives like a monk.</i>

01:12:01.026 --> 01:12:03.945
<i>This guy's got a lot of books.</i>

01:12:03.945 --> 01:12:07.741
MASTERS:

01:12:03.945 --> 01:12:07.741
<i>Remar, stop fucking around.</i>

01:12:03.945 --> 01:12:07.741
<i>Check the computer.</i>

01:12:10.618 --> 01:12:13.288
[MONITOR BEEPING]

01:12:13.288 --> 01:12:15.999
[KEYBOARD CLACKING]

01:12:21.296 --> 01:12:23.381
MASTERS:

01:12:21.296 --> 01:12:23.381
<i>This place is way</i>

01:12:21.296 --> 01:12:23.381
<i>too clean, boss.</i>

01:12:23.381 --> 01:12:25.884
<i>Something doesn't feel right.</i>

01:12:29.054 --> 01:12:32.766
MASTERS:

01:12:29.054 --> 01:12:32.766
We've got an empty script.

01:12:29.054 --> 01:12:32.766
"Meclizine."

01:12:34.309 --> 01:12:36.644
It's used for airsickness.

01:12:36.644 --> 01:12:38.939
Travel items purchased

01:12:36.644 --> 01:12:38.939
