01:12:43.484 --> 01:12:45.237
Leaves Logan 10 a.m. tomorrow.

01:12:45.237 --> 01:12:47.322
Guy knew this was coming.

01:12:45.237 --> 01:12:47.322
He's on the run.

01:12:47.322 --> 01:12:49.157
REMAR:

01:12:47.322 --> 01:12:49.157
Get someone at the airport.

01:12:49.157 --> 01:12:51.534
TEDDY:

01:12:49.157 --> 01:12:51.534
<i>He is not going anywhere.</i>

01:12:51.534 --> 01:12:53.703
MASTERS:

01:12:51.534 --> 01:12:53.703
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

01:12:55.496 --> 01:12:58.292
TEDDY:

01:12:55.496 --> 01:12:58.292
