01:14:53.698 --> 01:14:56.284
I understand.

01:14:53.698 --> 01:14:56.284
Do you?

01:14:56.284 --> 01:14:58.203
Just came for tea.

01:15:04.459 --> 01:15:06.002
Just, uh...

01:15:06.002 --> 01:15:08.713
Robert, I have very little

01:15:06.002 --> 01:15:08.713
influence these days.

01:15:08.713 --> 01:15:11.258
