01:15:11.258 --> 01:15:13.427
I consult on a few things.

01:15:11.258 --> 01:15:13.427
That's it.

01:15:13.427 --> 01:15:18.556
Susan, I just need to know

01:15:13.427 --> 01:15:18.556
