01:15:20.725 --> 01:15:22.643
[SIGHS]

01:15:25.897 --> 01:15:28.483
Who is he to you?

01:15:28.483 --> 01:15:30.944
That's why I'm here,

01:15:28.483 --> 01:15:30.944
trying to find out.

01:15:30.944 --> 01:15:33.071
Tell me what's going on.

01:15:30.944 --> 01:15:33.071
Please.

01:15:33.071 --> 01:15:35.782
[♪♪♪]

01:15:46.793 --> 01:15:49.212
You had a nice funeral,

01:15:46.793 --> 01:15:49.212
in case you were wondering.

01:15:49.212 --> 01:15:51.214
[BOTH CHUCKLE]

01:15:51.214 --> 01:15:54.509
You know, when they told Susan

01:15:51.214 --> 01:15:54.509
you were dead,

01:15:54.509 --> 01:15:56.970
she couldn't comprehend it.

01:15:56.970 --> 01:15:59.389
She said,

01:15:56.970 --> 01:15:59.389
"Oh, no. Not Robert. Uh-uh.

01:15:59.389 --> 01:16:02.683
And not from something

01:15:59.389 --> 01:16:02.683
as trivial as a car bomb."

01:16:02.683 --> 01:16:05.312
That you're alive

01:16:05.312 --> 01:16:08.523
is a big relief.

01:16:08.523 --> 01:16:12.444
But it didn't come

01:16:08.523 --> 01:16:12.444
as a complete surprise to her.

01:16:12.444 --> 01:16:15.155
We used to talk about you

01:16:12.444 --> 01:16:15.155
over the years, and she said

01:16:15.155 --> 01:16:18.241
if anyone could have

01:16:15.155 --> 01:16:18.241
figured a way out,

01:16:18.241 --> 01:16:21.495
a way to walk away from it all

01:16:18.241 --> 01:16:21.495
for good, you know,

01:16:21.495 --> 01:16:23.621
like a real fresh start...

01:16:24.956 --> 01:16:27.167
it would have been...

01:16:27.167 --> 01:16:28.543
you.

01:16:28.543 --> 01:16:31.463
[HELICOPTER WHIRRING]

01:16:31.463 --> 01:16:34.674
[♪♪♪]

01:17:01.451 --> 01:17:05.539
SUSAN:

01:17:01.451 --> 01:17:05.539
<i>You didn't take out</i>

01:17:01.451 --> 01:17:05.539
<i>five pimps, Robert.</i>

01:17:05.539 --> 01:17:09.543
You took out the East Coast hub

01:17:05.539 --> 01:17:09.543
of Vladimir Pushkin.

01:17:09.543 --> 01:17:10.918
ROBERT: Pushkin.

01:17:09.543 --> 01:17:10.918
Mm-hm.

01:17:10.918 --> 01:17:12.462
He's similar

01:17:10.918 --> 01:17:12.462
to the other oligarchs

01:17:12.462 --> 01:17:14.297
who jumped in bed

01:17:12.462 --> 01:17:14.297
with the Russian mafia,

01:17:14.297 --> 01:17:16.049
only he funds everything:

01:17:16.049 --> 01:17:18.885
gasoline, weapons,

01:17:16.049 --> 01:17:18.885
girls, you name it.

01:17:18.885 --> 01:17:21.596
He's built an intricate

01:17:18.885 --> 01:17:21.596
network on both U.S. coasts

01:17:21.596 --> 01:17:24.640
that are incredibly

01:17:21.596 --> 01:17:24.640
well-insulated.

01:17:24.640 --> 01:17:29.020
His money and political ties

01:17:24.640 --> 01:17:29.020
make him untouchable.

01:17:29.020 --> 01:17:33.774
Your friend here is who Pushkin

01:17:29.020 --> 01:17:33.774
sends when he's got a problem.

01:17:33.774 --> 01:17:37.778
Teddy Rensen.

01:17:33.774 --> 01:17:37.778
Real name, Nicolai Itchenko.

01:17:37.778 --> 01:17:40.156
Skill set honed in Spetsnaz.

01:17:40.156 --> 01:17:43.034
He's formidable and smart.

01:17:43.034 --> 01:17:45.620
Ran a wing of the secret

01:17:43.034 --> 01:17:45.620
police for years.

01:17:45.620 --> 01:17:47.539
Went private

01:17:45.620 --> 01:17:47.539
when the Union fell.

01:17:47.539 --> 01:17:50.875
Basically, he's a sociopath

01:17:47.539 --> 01:17:50.875
with a business card.

01:17:50.875 --> 01:17:52.710
ROBERT:

01:17:50.875 --> 01:17:52.710
Mm.

01:17:54.254 --> 01:17:57.298
Thank you, darling.

01:17:54.254 --> 01:17:57.298
You know these two?

01:17:57.298 --> 01:17:59.342
Uh...

01:17:59.342 --> 01:18:02.887
Boston P.D. Probably on

01:17:59.342 --> 01:18:02.887
Pushkin's payroll, I assume.

01:18:02.887 --> 01:18:06.266
Three years. Detective Remar

01:18:02.887 --> 01:18:06.266
and Detective Pederson.

01:18:06.266 --> 01:18:09.769
Only now they're dead.

01:18:06.266 --> 01:18:09.769
They found them yesterday

01:18:09.769 --> 01:18:12.522
in the trunk of their car

01:18:09.769 --> 01:18:12.522
in the precinct parking lot.

01:18:12.522 --> 01:18:16.734
Suffocated. Testicles blown off

01:18:12.522 --> 01:18:16.734
and shoved down their throats.

01:18:16.734 --> 01:18:20.113
Classic Russian mob hit.

01:18:16.734 --> 01:18:20.113
Teddy's work.

01:18:20.113 --> 01:18:21.531
Third one,

01:18:20.113 --> 01:18:21.531
Detective Masters

01:18:21.531 --> 01:18:25.159
hasn't shown up for work

01:18:21.531 --> 01:18:25.159
