01:34:04.515 --> 01:34:07.851
The man had broken through.

01:34:04.515 --> 01:34:07.851
It was a miracle.

01:34:07.851 --> 01:34:11.355
One week later, intruders

01:34:07.851 --> 01:34:11.355
